{"slug":"The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-UTILITY-CUSTOM-MOVESETS-V3-EXAMPLE-38257","_id":"6813bf3e6d078cab6b9f2990","title":"UTILITY CUSTOM MOVESETS V3 EXAMPLE","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":10449761463},"features":"+ means new, = means fixes, ? Means testing later\n• Custom Movesets V3 is Custom movesets V2 but..\n  + Added the rest of the characters to ChrSel\n  + Added Custom VFX importing (returns the part of the .rbxm or the first part within the model in the .rbxm)\n  = Fixed only 1 move max glitch\n  + Function: ChrSel, adds character to character select, Syntax: ms:ChrSel(moveset name, image id (number or string), notice description (e.g. “Moveset made by <your name>”), onRespawnAfterClick (function)\n  + Function: Bind, Binds an animation to a function, syntax: ms:Bind(AnimationId (e.g. “rbxassetid://000000”), callback (function with syntax function(AnimationTrack)))\n  ? Idk if PC support is here yet.. I’m working on it!\n•\n\nSoon:\n  + Non-Auto Use support\n  + Support for changing character name colors\n  + Support for up to 2 movesets for scripts\n  + ult bar ui changing","tags":["TSB","Movesets","Custom moveset","TSBG","Custom movesets"],"script":"local Moveset=\"T\"\nlocal ms=loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/softbf395/Utilities/refs/heads/main/TSB/MovesetsV3.lua\"))()\nms:ReqChr(\"Saitama\" --[[Cyborg, Hunter, HunterMastery, Ninja, Blade, Bat, Purple, Esper, KJ]])\n--local SFXM1=ms:SFX(false, \"url\", \"path\")\n--local SFXM2=ms:SFX(false, \"url\", \"path\")\n--local SFXM3=ms:SFX(false, \"url\", \"path\")\n--local SFXM4=ms:SFX(false, \"url\", \"path\")\nms:ChrSel(\"Bye!\", 6005761509, \"Testing Notices\", function()\n    local music=ms:SFX(true, \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/softbf395/Utilities/refs/heads/main/TSB/V2/NoCopyrightSounds%20-%20Boom%20Kitty%20%26%20Waterflame%20-%20Citadel%20Bass%20House%20NCS%20-%20Copyright%20Free%20Music.mp3\", \"music/TSB/Template\")\nmusic:Play()\n\n-- ms:ImportVFX(\"VFX/example/VFX\", \"https://example.com/example.rbxm\") -- import a Part that holds VFX\n\nms:Ult(\"Ult Name\", Color3.fromRGB(255,255,255), function() print(\"Ult Activated!\") end)\nms:Create(5, --[[move ID, 1 to 9]] function() end, --[[Callback for when used]] 2, --[[Cooldown for custom moves]] \"Move Name\")\n\nms:Create(1, --[[move ID, 1 to 9]] function() print(\"Hi!!\") end, --[[Callback for when used]] 10, --[[Cooldown for custom moves]] \"Test\")\n  end)\n","owner":{"_id":"66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac","username":"Aedan_","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3a077ecbd79f423757ccff304321e242ee9d91f583f416a997274a4a18121b89.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac-1750038172110.jpeg"},"status":"offline","id":"66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3a077ecbd79f423757ccff304321e242ee9d91f583f416a997274a4a18121b89.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac-1750038172110.jpeg"}},"verified":false,"views":33181,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/caaf3557583a16e99dafc06099be9dcc0cf4ff7c3d56155f00a62015757c5be7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-ccd8bcf9f66dc37834534d2cb3cfd1b9-8bb7a35a0660.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-ccd8bcf9f66dc37834534d2cb3cfd1b9-8bb7a35a0660.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-05-01T18:36:46.629Z","editBy":{"_id":"66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac","username":"Aedan_","status":"offline","id":"66cf7adf9a3bc395eaefc1ac"},"executes":308,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"co